G_IMMUTABLE`.","+TASK-6: §7. Vendored workflow (`../app`, `IS_MOBILE`), F-Droid impact","+(no `fdroid/app.solyto.yml` change for the recommended path; Glance is","+flagged), i18n, theming, battery and testing.","+TASK-7: Summary/verdict, phased plan, open questions and dated sources.","+"," ## Known issues / follow-ups"," ","-<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->","+- Not verified (it would need a spike): whether","+  `window.Capacitor.Plugins.<Name>` works for a custom plugin without","+  `@capacitor/core` bundled in the web app. This is listed as an open","+  question.","+- Backend behaviour can't be determined from this repo: whether token","+  refresh invalidates the old token, revocation, and token lifetime.","+- Side observation, out of scope: the manifest declares a `VIEW","+  app.solyto://` intent filter, but there is no native handler and no","+  `@capacitor/app`, so these deep links only open the app and don't","+  navigate anywhere. It may be worth checking whether the auth verify/reset","+  deep links (`getDeepLinkUrl`) behave as intended."]}],"originalFile":"# Implementation: Audit: android homescreen widgets\n\nid: opinion\ndeveloper:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What was implemented, task by task. Reference task IDs. -->\n\n## Changes\n\n<!-- List of files changed and what changed in each. -->\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DmrqYgKbumNHozCmRaJzhL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
